    "3": {
      "text": "<C:0007,0000,>¿Qué quieres?<C:0003,0000,1400>\n<C:0005,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF><C:0008,0001,0A00><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Hablar un ratito.\n<C:0005,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF><C:0008,0001,0A00><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Ir al mundo de los sueños.\n<C:0005,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF><C:0008,0001,0A00><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Nada.",
