      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0001,0004,><C:0001,0001,><C:0000,0002,9600>¡Conde Pesadillo!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0004,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0001,0000,><C:0001,0003,>¡Por tu culpa me convertí\nen piedra!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>¡Y ahora estoy que me caigo\na cachos!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>¡Aaargh!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
